```javascript
function getLanguageFromSubdomain() {
    const url = new URL(window.location.href);
    const subdomain = url.hostname.split('.')[0];
    const languageMap = {
        'en': 'English',
        'ja': 'Japanese',
        'es': 'Spanish',
        'fr': 'French'
    };
    return languageMap[subdomain] || 'Unknown';
}
console.log(getLanguageFromSubdomain());
```
This function extracts the subdomain from the current URL, maps it to a language using a predefined object, and returns the language name. It handles unknown subdomains by returning 'Unknown'.
